Contemporary USA Wall Map
Perfect for home, business, or school, this Contemporary USA Wall Map combines bright, attractive colors with high-detailed cartography.
Details on this United States Wall Map include: state boundaries and capitals along with other major cities and towns; major physical features such as mountain ranges and major mountain peaks; major water features such as oceans, seas, gulfs, and rivers; the Interstate highway system and other major roads; and all National Parks as well as other large National Park Service sites.
Special features include ivory-colored oceans and a black decorative border. This map of the United States uses the Albers Equal Area projection.
Details on the map
Accurate map data and in-depth detailing make this US 50 States Map ideal for general reference. Each of the 50 states is named and differentiated with bright colors for easy recognition. State boundaries are depicted with line margins. Major cities and towns are named throughout the map extent in their true location.
International provinces are demarcated with contrasting tones and can be placed at a glance. Significant terrain features like mountains, intricate river systems, lakes, deserts and national parks can be visibly located on the frame. Highway systems are numbered and their route charts drawn out with clarity.
The map layout includes two useful insets of the states of Alaska and Hawaii along with an informative key table. The ivory backdrop of oceans and the colorful representation of landmass create a unique contrast adding style to information.
Location on the map
This political reference map of the US presents an overview of the country showing 48 contiguous states with their capitals and many major cities. The other two states of Alaska and Hawaii located between the nations of Canada and Mexico have been added in the inset. Each state is demarcated with boundaries and captioned with distinct fonts. The Capital Washington D.C is marked notable on the frame.
The map highlights the terrain features of the country with shaded relief. Mountain systems can be easily placed with uneven elevation. Important rivers, lakes and national parks are labeled and can be easily located. The Atlantic Ocean, The Pacific Ocean and the Gulf of Mexico surround the landmass creating an eye catching contrast with its ivory background.
National parks and conservation areas are captioned and highlighted with green isolated patches. The US has 62 national parks and Yellowstone National park was the first park in the US to be established in the year 1872.
The Concentration of population is depicted with dots of different sizes indicating population size of that region. The most densely populated city of the nation is New York City with an estimated population of 8,398,748.
State highways, interstate highways, US Route, and other primary and secondary roads are drawn out in detail with specific numbering and color coded thread margins for quick reference. The inland waterways, railway routes and airport locations are also indicated on the frame.
Alaska, the largest state in the US along with the Aleutian Islands and Hawaii are shown in two separate insets. Major towns and cities of this region are also marked in the inset along with their time zone boundaries. A globe locator added to the inset, indicates the continental placement of the USA.
With unique border detailing, this Large Map of the U.S makes an inspirational wall décor and adds character to any space.
An informative key table simplifies symbolic representations on the title frame like water depth, inland waterways, highways, time zones , national parks and more
Map Size and Projection
The map is available in 50.25x33 inch dimension in four different finishes. Albers Equal Area projection is used in the map for minimal distortion.
Uses of the Map
This creative piece has been designed in traditional style with an attractive color palette aiming to dress up any wall informatively as well as aesthetically.
Reference Use: With meticulous detailing this US 50 State Map is a perfect geographical guide useful for general reference in schools, homes and office spaces.
Wall Decor: Black motif border surrounding the ivory backdrop of oceans and the multicolored landmass creates uniqueness in design which instantly adds a style to any space.
Map Gift: A decorative border and contrast color schematics converts information into art and makes this map perfect for gifting.
